Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,worked,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Worked on the series:\N Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Pineapple, To
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,title,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(846,392)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,name,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(848,456)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.22,0:01:06.28,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,All characters are fictitious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.28,0:01:08.51,Default,Lilia1,0,0,0,,and the events shown are fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:16.85,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I owe you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.92,0:01:21.93,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I was thinking about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.73,0:01:25.60,Default,Lilia1,0,0,0,,when she tried to leave the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.97,0:01:31.00,Default,Lilia1,0,0,0,,I thought I would never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.33,0:02:00.60,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,An hour earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.64,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Spiral Potatoes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.57,0:02:15.41,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Are you sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.09,0:02:28.36,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Yes. I wrote this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.13,0:02:32.40,Default,Lilia1,0,0,0,,Did you actually write this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.73,0:02:34.00,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Not a queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.16,0:02:37.63,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,The Queen was at the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.07,0:02:40.10,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Then why did you file
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:42.91,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,wild grapes, pine needles and peaches?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.34,0:02:47.14,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,It’s just peach season,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:49.25,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,the wild grape season begins,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.25,0:02:51.35,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,and there are pine needles all year round.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.75,0:02:52.82,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Manbok.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.98,0:02:55.69,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Look me in the eyes and tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:14.34,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,The Queen didn't want you to know that she was helping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:22.91,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,It’s too late. Come back here tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.78,0:03:27.25,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Go back to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.95,0:03:30.85,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I will find out why she helped me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:33.59,Default,Lilia1,0,0,0,,and what do her words mean that she will betray me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:44.67,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.86,0:04:09.09,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,The Queen is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.57,0:04:20.20,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,When it dawns, I will inform the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.50,0:04:21.67,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Will he be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.81,0:04:24.41,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Take your time. This could be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.16,0:04:44.29,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Sometimes you sleep like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.93,0:04:49.13,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I think I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.64,0:04:56.27,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Were you looking after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.01,0:05:01.24,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Why do you always do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:06.42,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Worrying about me, trying to understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.85,0:05:12.69,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, you're the first person I saw when I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:21.06,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I owe you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.33,0:05:26.24,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I was thinking about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.04,0:05:29.87,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,when she tried to leave the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.94,0:05:32.94,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I thought I would never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:44.21,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Hon Young.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.68,0:06:50.12,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Looks like you're practicing a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:52.09,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,So pumped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.97,0:07:08.14,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,This is a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.31,0:07:09.71,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Hong Young turned into him
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:11.31,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,last time in my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:14.78,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:29.39,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,What is it? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.39,0:07:33.73,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,What happened? Who offended my queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.56,0:07:36.73,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,You. You offended me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.37,0:07:41.30,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Why was her face replaced with yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.84,0:07:42.84,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.01,0:07:45.11,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Be honest with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.38,0:07:47.48,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,What happened between us at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.84,0:07:49.71,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,How honest should I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.71,0:07:52.12,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Tell everything, leaving nothing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.45,0:07:58.15,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Lord. This is a strange request.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:01.42,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,If that's what you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.53,0:08:07.66,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,When the moon lit up the dark sky last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.66,0:08:10.83,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,our hands touched slightly, then fireworks...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.83,0:08:13.60,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Be quiet. If you say anything, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:14.67,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.67,0:08:17.67,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,This is just the beginning, my queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.34,0:08:20.48,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.28,0:08:22.48,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.88,0:08:27.98,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.95,0:08:31.92,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,as if I was abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:33.86,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.26,0:08:36.29,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Chief Eunuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.29,0:08:38.70,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Hon Young. Hong Young.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.60,0:08:40.86,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Where did you sleep today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.36,0:08:42.83,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,At home, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:47.07,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Cheoljong and I really...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.33,0:09:15.37,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,14 episode. The woman who must die to live
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.21,0:09:26.04,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,It was all a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:29.58,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,The portrait of the late king was burning,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.81,0:09:31.88,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,and everything seemed so real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.05,0:09:34.98,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,After what happened with the fortune teller,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.98,0:09:36.92,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I cannot predict my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.86,0:09:42.03,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Ominous premonition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.63,0:09:45.56,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Court lady Khan. I need to predict fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.46,0:09:49.07,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Your Majesty. This will cause you trouble again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.43,0:09:51.20,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I know a monk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.60,0:09:55.34,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,It won't look suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:04.95,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,When Avalokitesvara practiced deep Prajnaparamita,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.95,0:10:08.05,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,he illuminated five skandhas and saw that they were all empty...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.22,0:10:13.32,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.32,0:10:16.79,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I see that the palace is filled with scarlet blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.49,0:10:18.83,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Scarlet blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.23,0:10:21.73,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Today someone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.53,0:10:24.17,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,will die in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.50,0:10:27.97,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,And who?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:30.61,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I don’t know who it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.48,0:10:39.75,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,but it will be a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.25,0:10:41.35,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.55,0:10:45.16,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Really
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.26,0:10:47.76,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,will it be me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:51.09,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Draw me a talisman for protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.09,0:10:53.80,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I am not a shaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:56.20,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,There must be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.87,0:10:58.23,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,If you insist,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.00,0:11:01.30,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,make an offering to Buddha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.44,0:11:05.14,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Exactly. I'll give you as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.08,0:11:09.78,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,The one who dies in the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.11,0:11:12.45,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,it won’t be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.72,0:11:16.79,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.45,0:11:21.06,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I didn’t ask the queen the question I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.09,0:11:23.09,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.39,0:11:25.03,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I will return to Daejeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.53,0:11:26.56,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.13,0:11:31.67,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.94,0:11:35.14,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Given how suddenly he disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.04,0:11:42.18,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.51,0:11:44.75,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I can draw it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.39,0:11:54.62,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,This one will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:02.27,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Correct. Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.13,0:12:05.67,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I see clearly. Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.84,0:12:09.64,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,No! Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.01,0:12:13.34,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,His face...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.38,0:12:18.88,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,This is his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:23.42,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Hon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.73,0:12:31.79,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Did you cry all the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:37.07,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Well. Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.07,0:12:38.90,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Well. Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.57,0:12:43.17,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Why didn’t I think that she might not like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:47.91,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Why have I been thinking for so many days,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:50.55,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,choose love or family?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.21,0:12:53.82,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,The biggest obstacle in love is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.82,0:12:56.02,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,this is nothing more than
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.02,0:12:58.29,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,winning the heart of the one you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.46,0:13:01.06,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,What is the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.56,0:13:02.73,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,She said:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:04.99,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I don’t like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.83,0:13:06.90,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.80,0:13:08.80,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.57,0:13:11.70,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.77,0:13:15.34,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Tell why.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.87,0:13:17.31,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,Why don’t you like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.81,0:13:22.98,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.31,0:13:26.28,Default,Lily1,0,0,0,,I don’t like ambitious men.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.28,0:13:30.65,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Hush, hush.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:35.19,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Here is the dampness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.89,0:13:39.46,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Love begins with moisture
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:42.03,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,and it ends with such dampness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.93,0:13:46.64,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,-But...\N-Damn, I scared you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.67,0:13:48.20,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,There is good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:50.11,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,The king felt better,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.21,0:13:52.71,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,my prayers were answered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:56.08,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've heard something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.25,0:14:01.72,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Kim Jwageun will be demoted because of this incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.49,0:14:05.76,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I like the king, and I respect Kim Jwageun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:08.56,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,My heart is breaking into pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.69,0:14:11.89,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,How can you love the king, because you don’t know him personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.40,0:14:15.67,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,After all, he is your best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:17.60,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,You are a good person,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.60,0:14:19.60,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,so your friend should be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.40,0:14:22.67,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Well, you've wrapped it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.21,0:14:30.75,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Are you drawing an octopus?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:33.55,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,What does “octopus” mean? This is a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.05,0:14:36.15,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.72,0:14:39.02,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I drew it well, if you look closely at the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.89,0:14:43.16,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,-These must be the eyes.\N-This is the mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:48.00,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,-Is that his mouth?\N-Can’t you see his lips?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.87,0:14:56.94,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Predictions are best read in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.41,0:15:01.81,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,The Queen Mother, Her Highness is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.18,0:15:07.25,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.85,0:15:11.99,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,You have no face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.79,0:15:16.93,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,As if the king had not woken up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.46,0:15:20.06,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,How are things going with the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.06,0:15:23.23,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I don’t see any benefit from it anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:25.70,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,and did what you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.54,0:15:29.21,Default,Spillit2,0,0,0,,I'm sure that item
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.21,0:15:31.34,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,found in her chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.71,0:15:35.71,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,The king spent last night in the queen’s chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.95,0:15:37.98,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Immediately, how did you recover?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.15,0:15:40.38,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Because of that incident with the explosion, I realized
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.52,0:15:44.65,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,that if I lose it, I’ll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.35,0:15:47.49,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,The woman who will die today...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.12,0:15:49.63,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Really?..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:21.46,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.89,0:16:23.43,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Should I kill myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.63,0:16:25.50,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Maybe if I die, I will feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.17,0:16:35.81,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Sorry, queen, have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.11,0:16:38.74,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,I denied everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:41.04,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,but the king was so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.28,0:16:43.61,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.05,0:16:46.18,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.18,0:16:49.39,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Can you smell the burning?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.55,0:16:52.52,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Whose hands are they doing? Any of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:53.72,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,-Where are you going?\N-Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.96,0:16:57.36,Default,Spillit2,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:03.73,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,In the end
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.53,0:17:06.70,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,I told him everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.01,0:17:11.07,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:13.61,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Let me make this clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.61,0:17:16.01,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,The king came to me yesterday, talking to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.01,0:17:18.21,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,and therefore all this chaos. So?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.21,0:17:19.75,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I didn’t say anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.38,0:17:23.79,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,So I'm so confused
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.25,0:17:27.56,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.76,0:17:30.26,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What? Why are you confused?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.26,0:17:31.86,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.20,0:17:35.67,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,That was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.80,0:17:38.20,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Maybe even better than last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:41.00,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,This is why I'm going crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:44.31,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Why did I like it? This shouldn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.21,0:17:46.81,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,So the soul doesn’t control the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.14,0:17:49.01,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,So the mind and body are beyond our control?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:51.08,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Hormones rule everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:54.32,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,-Nightmare.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.85,0:17:58.85,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,-What’s wrong with her?\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.69,0:18:00.99,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.29,0:18:05.90,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,She is in her own spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:10.80,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you feel disgusted?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.33,0:18:13.00,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.80,0:18:18.21,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Feel! Feel disgusted. You must hate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.21,0:18:20.34,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Get ready to greet His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.72,0:18:28.08,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Where is my queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:30.15,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, she...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.06,0:18:37.56,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Sorry. She was just here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:41.56,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Did she go this far to hide from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.83,0:18:43.93,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Last night like a tigress...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.93,0:18:45.60,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Rrrrr!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.04,0:18:53.21,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Can you help me find the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.64,0:18:54.74,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.91,0:18:57.01,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,As you can see, I have a lot to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:02.15,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,I wonder what exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.03,0:19:11.63,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,No. If I meet him now, I'll be in deep trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.06,0:19:13.96,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What if my body betrays me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:15.36,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:18.47,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I’m sure the spirit of Kim So-yeon possessed him last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.10,0:19:23.04,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,And I only liked it because I thought it was Hong Young.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.04,0:19:24.77,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,If only I knew it was him...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:29.31,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,But I still like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.38,0:19:32.21,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I'm definitely going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.59,0:19:43.09,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What if Jang Bong-hwan disappears forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.69,0:19:45.83,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What if?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.83,0:19:47.03,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I shouldn’t have gotten here.\NJang Bong-hwan
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.03,0:19:48.97,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,-My queen.\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:50.67,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.67,0:19:51.70,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.10,0:19:54.17,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.87,0:19:56.94,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.14,0:20:00.18,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.41,0:20:02.48,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.41,0:20:06.72,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.62,0:20:14.62,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.79,0:20:16.89,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.93,0:20:20.00,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.06,0:20:23.07,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.97,0:20:28.54,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Kim Jwageun is about to lose his position,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:30.97,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,after all, he made it clear that he was trying to get rid of the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.27,0:20:32.31,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.24,0:20:36.28,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,The more I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.28,0:20:38.28,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,the more I am convinced that this is not his style.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.05,0:20:40.65,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Surely he feels driven into a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.98,0:20:42.89,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Because of that explosion
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.89,0:20:45.12,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Kim Jwageun lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.65,0:20:47.99,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,On the other hand, the king only won.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.99,0:20:49.23,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Even if so,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.23,0:20:52.29,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I doubt that the king himself caused the explosion, risking his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.80,0:20:54.90,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,And it’s true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:20:59.97,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.10,0:21:02.44,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,-Are you going to the council?\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.87,0:21:06.24,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,May I ask, why are you all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.28,0:21:08.28,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,My queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.38,0:21:09.45,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,-Queen?\N-Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.95,0:21:17.45,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, are you playing hide and seek?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.82,0:21:20.16,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,-I play them great!\N-Hush.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.20,0:21:29.27,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Found.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.27,0:21:31.57,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,Infuriating. Stop stalking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.57,0:21:33.44,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Are you a paparazzi? Or a stalker?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.44,0:21:34.97,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,-Got it.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.97,0:21:37.17,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.17,0:21:39.24,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,-See you at the royal council.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.44,0:21:41.74,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Let's discuss everything calmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.74,0:21:42.78,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.78,0:21:44.88,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,They are completely crazy with love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.88,0:21:46.88,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,-My queen!\N-Playing hide and seek?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.42,0:21:48.95,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Like small children.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.95,0:21:52.76,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What? Plays hide and seek when
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.39,0:21:54.86,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,almost died recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.13,0:22:00.33,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Exactly. There are royal concubines.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.46,0:22:02.20,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,We had a love correspondence all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.20,0:22:04.83,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,They are the guardian angels of my sexual orientation!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.83,0:22:07.14,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, we welcome you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.14,0:22:08.84,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.17,0:22:12.41,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Well, have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.51,0:22:16.51,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.35,0:22:19.11,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,You shouldn’t run around the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.78,0:22:22.59,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,It seems that these two, except each other, need no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.79,0:22:24.82,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Seems like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.82,0:22:28.86,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,By the way, how lovely they look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.06,0:22:37.77,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Excellent. Let's write to the ladies,\Nand deviations in orientation will no longer happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.27,0:22:41.24,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,-My queen. \N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.97,0:22:43.97,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.86,0:23:07.13,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,And she’s not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:12.33,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I’m not just running after her. I want to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.87,0:23:14.10,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.10,0:23:16.44,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,But she seems uncomfortable around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.04,0:23:19.21,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,It’s time to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.94,0:23:22.71,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I hope that when she has feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.45,0:23:26.42,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,decides, she will come to me herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.26,0:23:36.53,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,, -It's time to go to the meeting room. \N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.63,0:23:41.76,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.97,0:23:44.77,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,It looks like you walked around the entire palace today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.77,0:23:46.27,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I’ve been running after you since the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.90,0:23:48.10,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.51,0:23:54.11,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Here you are. Last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.78,0:23:57.18,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Let's discuss everything along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.81,0:23:58.85,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.55,0:24:00.68,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.68,0:24:02.82,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Shall we go somewhere again?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.36,0:24:07.79,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,The palace is too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.35,0:24:34.38,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.42,0:24:39.39,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,What did he want to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.69,0:24:44.46,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,What do men ask in such situations?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.13,0:24:47.16,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Well, was it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.41,0:24:58.71,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Send as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.74,0:25:01.98,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.58,0:25:05.88,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Something is wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.28,0:25:08.32,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.49,0:25:10.59,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.85,0:25:12.96,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Why don’t you tell me off anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.12,0:25:15.96,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,It’s not appropriate to leave your chambers like this, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.66,0:25:17.83,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I need to remind everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.13,0:25:20.43,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I decided not to reprimand you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.93,0:25:22.20,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.40,0:25:24.53,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Why is this all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.53,0:25:27.77,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,-Okay, go. \N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.54,0:25:32.71,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.02,0:25:57.12,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,From today
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.66,0:26:01.49,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I resign as regent.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.80,0:26:45.90,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,And therefore
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.01,0:26:49.21,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,from now on I will rule alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.54,0:26:54.45,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Long life to the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.70,0:27:14.00,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,At this rate I will soon die.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.03,0:27:18.40,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,All these experiences will finish me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.10,0:27:21.47,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Let me know that you are not hungry today?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.91,0:27:25.28,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Do you want to hasten my demise?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.54,0:27:26.91,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.68,0:27:28.88,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,However
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.18,0:27:32.92,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I still can’t decide whether to order the food to be carried or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.92,0:27:36.02,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,If I order you to bring it, you will be angry,\Nthat we remember you until your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.76,0:27:39.73,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,What, even such simple things
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.73,0:27:41.93,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,can’t you decide without me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.03,0:27:44.13,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Dowager Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.43,0:27:47.83,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Please, moderate your anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.80,0:27:53.91,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Can you not be angry in such a situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.14,0:27:57.64,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I have practically lost my influence in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.61,0:28:00.75,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I will help return the former power.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.65,0:28:04.98,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,You will become regent again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.12,0:28:07.55,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,And you are very self-confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.55,0:28:10.62,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Your father was the same in his youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.96,0:28:14.66,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,This is the last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.19,0:28:17.06,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,And what needs to be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.43,0:28:20.37,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Find a way to undermine the king’s spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.53,0:28:24.67,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,If everything goes well for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.67,0:28:27.17,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,think only about yourself and try not to give yourself away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.14,0:28:29.24,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.24,0:28:32.84,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,However, it is unlikely that the old methods will be effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.01,0:28:37.15,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Don’t underestimate the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.42,0:28:41.52,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Do you really think that the explosion was his doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.22,0:28:45.39,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,As a rule, the one who benefits most is to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.89,0:28:48.66,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I can’t believe that I gave the throne to such an insidious scoundrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.83,0:28:58.27,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, congratulations on the end of the regency.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.74,0:29:00.94,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.11,0:29:05.41,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,While you were away, a message was delivered
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.41,0:29:07.18,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,from the Daejojon pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.11,0:29:09.92,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,-From the queen? \N-Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.69,0:29:19.59,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I’m trying to convey in words how I languish with longing for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.89,0:29:21.06,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,and I miss you even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.43,0:29:26.20,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Something needs to be done about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.04,0:29:34.97,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,My desperate pleas were heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.61,0:29:36.71,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,What a persistent one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.71,0:29:38.91,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,We need to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.12,0:29:44.48,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Are you here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.92,0:29:47.05,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,To save me from these torments...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.29,0:29:49.39,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Choljong?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.82,0:29:51.12,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,How did you know where I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.29,0:29:53.29,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,How is this? You made the appointment yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.29,0:29:55.96,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,-And a concubine called me here!\N-Which concubine?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.96,0:29:57.63,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,When you don’t know, it’s even more interesting,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.63,0:29:59.36,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,so I didn’t ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.77,0:30:01.30,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,In any case, I didn’t write to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.70,0:30:04.00,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Sometimes thoughts of a different kind come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.54,0:30:08.24,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I wish I could drown in a stream of thoughts about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.74,0:30:11.84,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Cling to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.71,0:30:17.52,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Oh! I wouldn't let you go for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.68,0:30:19.58,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,-Enough. \N-Have you gotten it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.15,0:30:21.19,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.29,0:30:23.26,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Not lyrics, but some kind of shame. First time I've heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.26,0:30:25.42,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Your name will be on my lips until I rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.62,0:30:27.89,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Will occupy all my thoughts, I will never forget him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.99,0:30:29.66,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Enough. There are people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.06,0:30:33.50,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,So what? It wasn't you who wrote it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.37,0:30:42.74,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,We need to discuss something. Leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.74,0:30:43.88,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.88,0:30:45.91,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.92,0:30:55.19,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Are you secretly following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.32,0:30:56.96,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Are you reading the correspondence?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.62,0:30:58.82,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.42,0:31:01.83,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,You confess your love in messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.83,0:31:03.46,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,And when we see each other, you pretend to be indifferent.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.40,0:31:05.83,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,How can you be so cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.67,0:31:12.07,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Or the letter was delivered to the wrong place?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.80,0:31:14.57,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,It turns out that the messages were not intended for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.57,0:31:16.68,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,It turns out that it was because of you that my heart skipped a beat?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.48,0:31:19.85,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Are you my last chance to return the male strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.05,0:31:23.01,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,It’s because of you that my heart breaks every night
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.05,0:31:25.52,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,trembling?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.95,0:31:27.85,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,So this is the reason for your split.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.22,0:31:30.32,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Why was it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.56,0:31:32.22,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Why is it always you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.22,0:31:34.43,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Even in my dreams you appear to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.16,0:31:36.53,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Did I appear to you in your dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.03,0:31:40.60,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Watch your language. One more stupidity and this can be considered a confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.90,0:31:42.73,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,There are different dreams, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.00,0:31:44.74,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Nightmares, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.87,0:31:47.34,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Why did you help me at the feast?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.54,0:31:51.71,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Followed me to ask this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.41,0:31:54.78,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I could thank you. In vain it only helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.98,0:31:56.78,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,She said it herself, swear - if you’re glad to see,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.78,0:31:59.15,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,and look for a fight, if grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.28,0:32:01.52,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Why did you suddenly decide to listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.52,0:32:03.42,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I did it your way, but you’re still unhappy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.92,0:32:06.06,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.49,0:32:08.73,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,We distance ourselves, then suddenly you help.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.73,0:32:11.20,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Then you suddenly declare that you would easily betray me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.86,0:32:13.23,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Yes, then I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.23,0:32:16.27,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.34,0:32:20.34,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,So did you hear everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.47,0:32:24.58,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,It turns out that he lied about losing his hearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.68,0:32:26.81,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.01,0:32:29.68,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,It turns out that the explosion was your doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.62,0:32:32.62,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I really lost my hearing for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.22,0:32:35.95,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,But he returned just as you were saying these words.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.86,0:32:39.39,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind? You could have died!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.55,0:32:40.40,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,My queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.50,0:32:42.55,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Why risk yourself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.21,0:33:04.58,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,What? This is a prohibited technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.88,0:33:07.52,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,You always hug, smile, sleep next to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.59,0:33:09.25,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,All this is prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.92,0:33:14.73,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I forbid you to forbid me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.34,0:33:27.24,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.31,0:33:33.48,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,So amorous?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.78,0:33:36.21,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,All because of one night spent together? \NYou shouldn't have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.21,0:33:37.62,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,No, that’s not why.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.62,0:33:39.25,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.22,0:33:43.72,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,You are arrogant, narcissistic, uncouth
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.89,0:33:45.16,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,and fickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.59,0:33:47.09,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,You have many shortcomings.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.73,0:33:50.60,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,That’s the point. So don't love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.60,0:33:52.53,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,But I still love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.67,0:33:56.57,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,And I will love, let you have
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.44,0:33:58.97,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,all the shortcomings of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.85,0:34:10.95,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Remember what I said
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.29,0:34:14.82,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,the night before,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.02,0:34:17.39,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,how to jump into a pond?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.29,0:34:21.43,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,You must love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.20,0:34:26.46,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I said this because it seemed to me then
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.46,0:34:27.90,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,that only I can protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.03,0:34:31.84,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Because I thought that there was no other way to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.20,0:34:34.71,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,That this is the only way to save both you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.97,0:34:37.44,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,So this is the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.44,0:34:38.54,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.88,0:34:42.68,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,That Kim So-yeon is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.05,0:34:45.98,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Ta Kim So-yeon died that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.49,0:34:52.02,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I won’t hurt you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.53,0:34:56.33,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,We have no future.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.06,0:35:00.57,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Because I will never forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.94,0:35:05.90,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I am not Kim So-yeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.30,0:35:08.61,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Therefore, I have no right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.26,0:35:29.46,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,What people. Does Her Majesty need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.50,0:35:33.30,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,-Thanks for your help. \N-Help?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.53,0:35:35.97,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,In the palace infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.03,0:35:38.64,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Ah, that’s it, I’m just...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.64,0:35:41.24,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,I gave you poisoned water.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.47,0:35:45.51,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,So be it, but they also ordered acupuncture with moxibustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.24,0:35:48.85,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,And therefore I should thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.92,0:35:53.05,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Found it on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.09,0:35:56.25,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.83,0:36:06.23,Default,Tolenka3,0,0,0,,Where did she find such an expensive thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.24,0:36:12.94,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Attempt on the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.34,0:36:16.04,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you consult with us before starting this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.04,0:36:17.88,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Look what this led to.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.88,0:36:21.61,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Kim Jwageun must have reached his limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.76,0:36:33.39,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I understand, you wanted money,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.39,0:36:34.79,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,but sell our weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.09,0:36:36.80,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Are you trying to destroy this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.80,0:36:38.73,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,You made it clear that there are no problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.03,0:36:41.97,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,You need people to achieve your goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.97,0:36:43.97,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,And for this we need money.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.17,0:36:47.54,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Are you saying you did this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.54,0:36:50.81,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I wanted to show the results without interfering with you in the process itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.81,0:36:52.24,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I did everything for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.68,0:36:54.21,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I tried for you
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.48,0:36:58.18,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,and for the sake of our kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.85,0:37:01.92,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Get ready
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.92,0:37:04.96,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,take responsibility if there is no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.80,0:37:12.76,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I will give you a chance to atone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.54,0:37:24.14,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,-Has everyone arrived?\N-Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.31,0:37:28.25,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,The queen’s father is not yet there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.58,0:37:31.12,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,He was not invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.52,0:37:34.99,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,We are gathered here because of his mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.39,0:37:37.52,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,He kept records of property,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.59,0:37:40.43,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,belonging to our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.80,0:37:49.00,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Fortunately, I have this accounting book.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.54,0:37:54.31,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,As long as my influence remains, she is useless,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.31,0:37:55.64,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,and you don’t need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.68,0:37:58.71,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.28,0:38:02.48,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,as soon as I lose my influence,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.02,0:38:07.09,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I can’t protect the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.36,0:38:12.62,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,If you protect me,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.12,0:38:15.23,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I will protect you in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.93,0:38:18.23,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,If we decide to protect you,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.66,0:38:19.80,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,what
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.03,0:38:23.00,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,will you do with the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.97,0:38:25.27,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,If we don’t do anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.27,0:38:28.81,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,he will kick us out because we did not remove you from your position.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.87,0:38:32.91,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,A council was formed to solve government problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.25,0:38:36.45,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Border Security Council?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.08,0:38:39.45,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,The incompetent king takes power into his own hands -
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.45,0:38:41.45,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,serious state problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.52,0:38:44.72,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,All policy decisions
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.99,0:38:48.43,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,will be considered by the Border Protection Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.76,0:38:52.26,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I have prepared everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.60,0:38:55.60,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,As you said, we froze the water with arsenic inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.60,0:38:58.17,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,When the ice melted, arsenic came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.17,0:39:00.67,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,How long does it take for arsenic to dissolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.27,0:39:02.91,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,It depends on the weather,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.24,0:39:05.38,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,but in tea it won’t take much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.78,0:39:07.85,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.45,0:39:12.08,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,By the way, may I know who your target is?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.98,0:39:15.62,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,If I get rid of one woman in the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.85,0:39:18.92,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,two men threatening my position will be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.47,0:39:36.17,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Thank you for standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.51,0:39:40.55,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,You endured such painful torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.91,0:39:43.08,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I won't forget this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.12,0:39:48.89,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Now that you have been exposed, it is dangerous to remain in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.82,0:39:51.29,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Leave the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.49,0:39:54.79,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,It's time for you to live your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.98,0:40:46.44,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I will do everything
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.08,0:40:52.58,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,to make your dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.91,0:41:16.24,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Somehow it became empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.01,0:41:20.55,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Which of you still wants...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.68,0:41:23.75,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,You are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.11,0:41:48.54,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I have to put
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.67,0:41:53.24,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,a hexagonal ice cube in the queen's bowl?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.65,0:41:55.68,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.08,0:42:02.35,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Just add an ice cube. This is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.50,0:42:16.53,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.44,0:42:21.31,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I have very important information.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.94,0:42:24.44,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.31,0:42:27.35,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,What have you got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.71,0:42:30.62,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,If you promise to spare me...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.18,0:42:32.85,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.25,0:42:34.32,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Court lady Khan.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.46,0:42:41.53,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I know you are a brave girl, but now you are trembling with fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.63,0:42:44.53,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I don’t know what you have there,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.23,0:42:47.60,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,but I will help you with everything I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.00,0:42:52.84,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Kim Jwageun asked me...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.71,0:42:58.91,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Why didn’t he like her from the very beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.44,0:43:01.31,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Then Kim So-yeon would not have tried to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.31,0:43:02.88,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,And I wouldn’t be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.88,0:43:06.25,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,But more importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.59,0:43:14.16,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I thought I had experienced everything possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.09,0:43:18.60,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,But, apparently, there was something that I had not encountered.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.46,0:43:21.47,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,How to explain that feeling last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.77,0:43:26.94,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,If everything before was like a soft piece of bread,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.94,0:43:28.17,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,then it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.21,0:43:35.05,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,No, that was new. \NI was interested in something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.58,0:43:37.08,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Come to yourselves, Chan So-yeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.02,0:43:41.02,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Damn it. I even confuse the names.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.29,0:43:43.39,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.52,0:43:45.99,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Yes. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.40,0:43:55.13,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,The Queen Dowager asked you to have breakfast together.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.23,0:43:58.67,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Breakfast at this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.61,0:44:04.14,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I'm not in the mood to cook right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.38,0:44:11.82,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen has already prepared everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.42,0:44:14.82,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Am I going to the Dongmyeongjong Hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.19,0:44:17.09,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I've been running all day today - so I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.86,0:44:20.66,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,They want to get rid of the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.49,0:44:23.76,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,The accounting book is now with Kim Jwagyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.40,0:44:25.90,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Who knew she was in the Daejojong Hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.36,0:44:27.53,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.63,0:44:30.07,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I will return to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.01,0:44:37.07,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.19,0:44:53.96,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Why are you stuck? Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.96,0:44:55.13,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.77,0:45:08.97,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,You're leaving me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.44,0:45:14.25,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,You know, Imp, I’m starting to get angry with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.23,0:45:31.13,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.00,0:45:34.73,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Breakfast, and with such a beautiful view.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.00,0:45:38.20,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I'm no longer regent, so I have a lot of free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.54,0:45:40.84,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,We should have breakfast together more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.47,0:45:43.54,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.82,0:45:54.49,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Breakfast cannot be without drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.16,0:46:03.06,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,The one who will die in the palace today is the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.30,0:46:07.77,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,My son,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.73,0:46:11.14,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I can finally take revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.53,0:47:18.54,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I specially prepared the ice,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.54,0:47:21.61,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,which is more expensive than gold today.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.48,0:47:28.08,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I will see ice here for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.68,0:47:31.15,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,It’s so hot today,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.18,0:47:34.32,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,ideal time for a cool drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.86,0:47:47.63,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,My queen. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.77,0:47:49.10,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I beg you. My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.30,0:48:12.43,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,How dare you...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.53,0:48:17.44,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I have to tell the queen something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.54,0:48:19.10,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,How dare you come here? Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.10,0:48:21.01,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,This is very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.67,0:48:23.77,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Damhyan?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.04,0:48:25.84,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.84,0:48:27.98,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I will have problems because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.91,0:48:31.05,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,What's so important?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.82,0:48:38.62,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Do you know this court lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.29,0:48:43.09,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Yes. I often see her in the royal kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.86,0:48:47.06,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Damhyan, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.67,0:48:49.10,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,The thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.27,0:48:54.94,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.75,0:49:02.81,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.60,0:49:22.77,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I have come to attend the dowager queen's meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.73,0:49:26.34,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,These are women's gatherings. You didn't have to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.40,0:49:30.51,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,This is the first time I see the queen at such a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.08,0:49:32.34,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.78,0:49:35.98,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,It’s an honor for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.31,0:49:39.42,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,How are things going with keeping an eye on your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.02,0:49:48.23,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Now that the king has woken up,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.33,0:49:50.43,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I will do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.93,0:49:55.57,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,We need to drink before the precious ice melts.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.88,0:50:08.15,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,How do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.35,0:50:10.92,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,The taste is so refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.85,0:50:16.42,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I liked it so much that I couldn’t resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.23,0:50:59.33,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,My queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.47,0:51:11.54,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.91,0:51:18.12,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.38,0:51:20.45,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,What have you done here?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.35,0:51:25.99,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,-Are you okay?\N-What? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.12,0:51:28.63,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,How dare you throw a stone at the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.33,0:51:32.06,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I'm fine, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.14,0:51:40.17,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Take this girl into custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.84,0:51:42.87,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,She will be punished for what she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.24,0:51:46.28,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.78,0:51:49.88,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.32,0:51:52.42,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Damhyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.93,0:52:03.49,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,She is very important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.53,0:52:06.76,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I'm fine, so don't be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.76,0:52:08.73,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.20,0:52:11.54,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,She made a mess in the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.54,0:52:13.67,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,and violated the established order.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.74,0:52:16.37,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,She's just a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.81,0:52:18.41,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I'm sure she had a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.41,0:52:20.04,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,She wouldn't do it without a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.04,0:52:21.65,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,If you continue like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.65,0:52:23.71,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I will accuse her of inappropriate behavior
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.71,0:52:25.62,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,and I will punish you even more severely.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.35,0:52:32.42,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Why did you come in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.19,0:52:37.19,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Did you really know that the child would try to harm the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.10,0:52:40.96,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Are you trying to drag me into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.07,0:52:44.74,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,It’s just that the time of your arrival coincided perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.77,0:52:46.40,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I was worried,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.40,0:52:48.91,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,that the person who planned treason,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.91,0:52:50.54,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,is located next to the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.08,0:52:52.74,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,This meeting is ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.24,0:52:54.71,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I will return to Dongmyeongjong.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.96,0:53:09.86,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I will definitely punish the child for violating our plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.46,0:53:12.50,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,You will also take responsibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.93,0:53:14.80,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,so as not to endanger our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.27,0:53:23.44,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,What will happen to her now?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.54,0:53:26.21,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,They won’t spank the girl, will they?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.41,0:53:28.08,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.08,0:53:30.88,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Maybe your tongue is going numb or your heart is beating like crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.05,0:53:33.68,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,What are you even talking about?\NReally...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.68,0:53:35.09,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.19,0:53:38.06,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,The queen and I are going to Daejojon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.66,0:53:39.96,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.34,0:53:57.34,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Please, from now on
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.91,0:54:00.51,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,watch everything you eat or drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.35,0:54:03.25,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Did I annoy someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.18,0:54:09.99,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I'm sure Kim Jwageun and the Queen Dowager tried to poison you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.32,0:54:14.36,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Some kind of nonsense. I didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.86,0:54:20.40,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Or is it all because I helped with the feast?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.27,0:54:22.67,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Found in your chambers
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.23,0:54:25.94,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,account book.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.97,0:54:28.01,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Account book?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.61,0:54:33.34,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,So Kim Jwageun and my father asked me about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.24,0:54:36.25,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,What's wrong with this book?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.28,0:54:39.42,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,You didn’t bring her with you from home?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.02,0:54:41.62,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Yes, I had no idea that she existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.62,0:54:44.02,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I haven’t seen her at home, and even more so here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.82,0:54:47.02,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,That's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.83,0:54:49.79,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,They wanted to poison, not overthrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.73,0:54:53.66,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,So Damhyang saved me?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.13,0:54:55.20,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,It turns out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.43,0:54:56.90,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Poison in the drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.07,0:55:00.10,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I took a couple of sips.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.44,0:55:03.24,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I’ll find out everything from Damhyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.57,0:55:05.01,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I'll ask her myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.34,0:55:07.85,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Will she be okay?\NShe shouldn't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.21,0:55:10.35,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,The one who planned to poison you,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.35,0:55:11.88,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,will not let her go just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.45,0:55:16.49,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Save her, I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.16,0:55:23.79,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.18,0:56:20.15,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I have not committed any crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.78,0:56:22.22,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I didn’t steal this money.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.05,0:56:25.49,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I've been saving them for many years,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.49,0:56:27.32,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,to ransom the youngest from slavery.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.20,0:56:33.30,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Please have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.46,0:56:36.93,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,If I die, my youngest...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.64,0:56:44.11,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Say everything you know
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.91,0:56:47.11,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,about this norig.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.73,0:57:04.90,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,-Damhyang!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.03,0:57:08.10,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Are you okay, queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.10,0:57:09.90,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I need to ask you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.30,0:57:12.04,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,What a blessing that you tried
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.47,0:57:16.24,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,drink before the ice melted.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.98,0:57:18.98,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.41,0:57:21.71,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Translate her now!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.71,0:57:22.71,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.52,0:57:27.99,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Where are you transferring her to? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.26,0:57:34.56,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, you should not be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.99,0:57:37.19,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,You know that she is not to blame for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.19,0:57:38.60,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I don’t understand you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.93,0:57:43.50,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,She is only guilty of saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.33,0:57:46.60,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I don’t know who told you this,\Nbut please,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.94,0:57:48.21,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,return to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.01,0:57:52.11,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,What if I refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.14,0:57:55.98,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,The girl will be tried in accordance with the laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.98,0:57:59.22,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,If you stay, you will suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.45,0:58:02.29,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Escort the queen to her chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.29,0:58:03.32,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.56,0:58:09.79,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,-Let me go!\N-I will accompany the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.17,0:58:20.00,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Go back to yourself, queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.64,0:58:24.64,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Loud scandals\Nyou will not help this girl in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.41,0:58:27.44,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.26,0:58:48.43,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Damhyang, I will free you soon.\NAgreed?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.93,0:58:51.77,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Fear nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.40,0:58:53.87,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.94,0:58:58.48,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Queen, we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.78,0:59:01.91,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I will set you free.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.50,0:59:31.37,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,How dare the lady of the court\Nthrow a stone at the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.37,0:59:32.98,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,This is an insult to the royal person!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.98,0:59:36.35,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Everything is much worse!\NThis is already treason!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.18,0:59:39.15,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I heard her father is accused of deviance
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.15,0:59:41.15,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,from military service and treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.15,0:59:42.85,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,As they say, blood is not water.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.25,0:59:46.62,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Dear ministers, you are overreacting.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.62,0:59:49.86,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,We don’t yet know what prompted her to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.16,0:59:53.00,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,The peasant uprising\Nis gaining momentum and
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.00,0:59:55.27,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,threatens the royal power.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.43,0:59:57.13,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Using this girl as an example, we must
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.13,0:59:58.97,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,strengthen your power among the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.97,1:00:00.97,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Now you are dragging in the rebel peasants?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.97,1:00:04.44,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,How dare she throw a stone at the queen?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.44,1:00:07.34,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I'm sure those bandits brainwashed her!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.58,1:00:11.25,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Brainwashed by bandits?\NThe girl is only five years old.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.25,1:00:13.02,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Don’t take it for insolence,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.25,1:00:15.82,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,but some believe\Nthat you, sir,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.15,1:00:19.32,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,living on Ganghwado,\Nwe talked with the rebel bandits.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.02,1:00:23.03,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Now you decide to threaten me with this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.86,1:00:26.70,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,If you refuse to punish the girl\Nand try to save her,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.03,1:00:31.54,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,you will only confirm our suspicions that
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.24,1:00:34.17,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,that you agree with the bandits.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.41,1:00:38.34,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,You just need to punish the maid for disobedience.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.98,1:00:40.68,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,And it will all be over.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.98,1:00:48.65,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,He will listen to us, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.25,1:00:52.46,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,The Queen Dowager\Nasked us to insist on punishment.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.09,1:00:55.43,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Takes out his anger on him for
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.43,1:00:57.06,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,that she was removed from the throne?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.49,1:00:59.80,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Like this worthless girl
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.80,1:01:04.17,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,dared to prevent us from getting rid of the queen?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.59,1:01:27.46,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,What took so long?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.59,1:01:29.99,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.69,1:01:33.50,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Such late meetings\Nnever lead to good things.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.17,1:01:37.80,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.66,1:02:02.56,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Here, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.56,1:02:03.66,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.40,1:02:12.84,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Remember this moment for the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.17,1:02:18.01,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,The courtiers in the palace\Nshould be blind and deaf to what is happening,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.98,1:02:22.85,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,there should not be a single rebellious thought in their minds.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.48,1:02:26.15,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,If at least one of you supports
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.15,1:02:29.75,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,peasant uprising, this is what awaits you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.29,1:02:33.26,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,The maid was a foolish child.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.06,1:02:36.13,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.33,1:02:41.30,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I thought we caught someone important,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.80,1:02:45.77,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,but this is just a child?\NIt’s incomprehensible!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.74,1:02:55.78,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Are we late?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.55,1:03:06.39,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Now you know how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.56,1:03:16.77,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,She wanted to save you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.97,1:03:19.20,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,That’s why they killed her.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.07,1:03:22.87,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,They wanted to poison me, but Damhyan prevented it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.48,1:04:07.88,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,She is not to blame for anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.89,1:04:10.15,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,You said it yourself,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.49,1:04:15.59,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,they laid their sins on a little child!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.56,1:04:22.80,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you save her?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.03,1:04:26.00,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,She became a victim in the name of something greater.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.80,1:04:28.84,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,More?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.71,1:04:31.98,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Are you talking about your own skin?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.78,1:04:38.01,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Didn’t you tell me that the world is unfair?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.85,1:04:42.65,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,An insignificant sacrifice will stop\Nsomething much more dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.09,1:04:45.26,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Insignificant victim?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.32,1:04:49.43,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Because
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.49,1:04:52.30,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,is she just a defenseless girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.00,1:04:57.43,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Amateurism is a sin.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.97,1:05:01.20,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,You couldn't save this girl!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.97,1:05:05.11,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,You are a sinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.60,1:05:32.40,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,If you don’t want to talk,\Nshould we use hand signals?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.40,1:05:33.50,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,For example, this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.50,1:05:35.71,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,This means that I’m lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.04,1:05:37.17,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.24,1:05:50.68,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.37,1:06:08.81,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,From this day on, I will become\Nthe craziest one in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.81,1:06:12.68,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I'll show you what happens when you piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.68,1:06:14.74,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Have you tried to get rid of the queen?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.91,1:06:16.65,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,-Damhyan!\N-Damhyan!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.01,1:06:19.25,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,I bet everything!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.25,1:06:20.65,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate Kim Byungin.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.65,1:06:22.45,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Even the Cho clan obeys him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.45,1:06:23.62,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Let's become allies.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.62,1:06:26.49,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,From now on, forget about distancing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.49,1:06:28.02,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Calm down, wild heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.02,1:06:30.19,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,All this is just a test.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.19,1:06:32.43,Default,Pineapple5,0,0,0,,Do you want to eat some ramen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.28,0:13:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,


